        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="社旗と社歌" tabindex="-1">社旗と社歌 <a class="header-anchor" href="#社旗と社歌" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;社旗と社歌&quot;">&ZeroWidthSpace;</a></h1>
